          "type": "text",
          "html": "There are several variants of the IC310: IC311 and <a href=\"/productos/haeny/bombas-manuales/ic-325-ic325-ccp\">IC325</a>. The IC311 has a slightly lower working pressure and is a little cheaper. On the IC311 the maximum pressure is 75 bar instead of 100 bar as on the IC310, but it has a higher flow of 2 m³/hour."
