          "html": "The <a href=\"/productos/haeny/bombas-manuales/ic-325-ic325-ccp\">IC325</a> variant, unlike the IC310, has two piston pumps, which gives a smoother flow. The maximum pressure is 100 bar and the maximum flow is 2 m³/hour."
